\newlabel{tab:s-perfire}{{S2}{3}{Focal-event pooled AUC and AUC on later burning of the thermal random forest (T) and the coordinate-only random forest (C), per fire. Window A: later burning to the end of 2023 (primary future population). Window B: January 2024 to September 2026, frozen focal scores. A dash marks a fire that was not eligible in that window (fewer than 30 later-burned cells)}{table.2}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces Main later-burning results with the original labels, whose unmapped mask used the land/water bit of the MCD64A1 quality layer, and with the corrected labels of plan amendment 15, which use the valid-data bit. The corrected results are the ones reported in the main text. Differences are thermal RF minus candidate; rule is the transfer-failure rule.}}{4}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
